sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cliente
  participant D as Document (context)
  participant R as DraftState
  participant M as ModerationState
  Note over D: estado atual = DraftState
  C->>D: submit()
  D->>R: submit(doc)
  R->>D: transitionTo(new ModerationState())
  Note over D: estado atual = ModerationState
  C->>D: edit("novo texto")
  D->>M: edit(doc, "novo texto")
  M-->>C: ❌ proibido durante a moderação
  C->>D: approve()
  D->>M: approve(doc)
  M->>D: transitionTo(new PublishedState())
